My recollection is that the TLZ04 is also a DDS device, so as
long as you both use the same data form (both fixed, or both
variable-sized blocks), everything should be OK, in terms of
the data being able to be read.  Being able to interpret the
data is of course another issue, but if you are going to
move it to another VMS system, that should work, as far as I
can see.
