>    the SUN keypad to look like a VT-100 keypad... yet not throw
>    away arrow keys e.g. shift to get keypad functions, and unshifted
>    to get arrow functions?

No, but you can use LSE/INTERFACE=DECW. This will enable the mouse + the
menu bar. If someone can tell me how to enable the numeric keypad, it'll
be very appreciated.

