this functionality, though at a price (UCX is basically free to educational sites
under the CSLG.)

>> Can I do all these thngs with
>> the system (DECstation) out of the box or am I wishful thinking???

  Various companies (BBC, a/Soft, TGV and others) provide tools that either make
VAX/VMS interoperate better with Ultrix/Unix or make the Ultrix/Unix environment
look more like VMS. These companies have an opportunity to sell their products
because the two operating systems don't interoperate perfectly "out of the box,"
despite nifty (!?) things like DECwindows, DECTPU and UCX.

