I have created a disktab entry like so:
	DK516C-16|Hitachi DK516C:\
		:ty=hitachi:ns#81:nt#15:nc#2179:\
		:pa#518805:ba#8192:fa#1024:\
		:pc#2606400:bc#8192:fc#1024:\
		:pe#419175:be#8192:fe#1024:\
